#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:5 0b29af0305a042cab26d34519e4e29e2
msgid "OpenDroneID Panel"
msgstr "OpenDroneID 面板"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:7 76b83f5eb4364ca9a6188028813b334e
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has a special Drone ID tab in its DATA view for use with "
"OpenDroneID modules attached to the autopilot which allows monitoring "
"status, attaching the required GPS for operator location of the GCS, and UAS"
" and Operator ID string setup."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 在其 DATA 视图中提供了专用的 Drone ID 标签页，与连接到飞控的 OpenDroneID "
"模块配合使用，可监控状态、为地面站运营商位置挂载所需 GPS，以及设置 UAS 和运营商 ID 字符串。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:9 962068a0512c47f3a1203885ee9bbdc6
msgid ""
"This feature is rapidly evolving and is available only on the latest Beta "
"Mission Planner updates. Updates will be made frequently so check for the "
"latest version, frequently."
msgstr "该功能正在快速演进，仅在最新 Beta 版 Mission Planner 更新中可用，将频繁更新，请经常检查最新版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:14 af3bf82a5dd64b8ba491aeb6cd6fb0fb
msgid ""
"This control manages the exchange of GCS/Operator information with the RID "
"module, via the AutoPilot connection."
msgstr "该控件通过飞控连接，管理 GCS/运营商信息与 RID 模块之间的数据交换。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:18 f21f5a0a5d154f788701038aeb42f9ae
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:20 fe3587c0f3be419783bbc713c721230c
msgid ""
"Mission Planner must have a source of GPS information about its location. "
"The GPS must provide valid NMEA GPGGA or GNGGA sentences."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 必须具有关于其位置的 GPS 信息来源，GPS 必须提供有效的 NMEA GPGGA 或 GNGGA 语句。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:22 7a67b1f7c0424c109dae9df99ce936e5
msgid ""
"This can be accomplished by either attaching a GPS to the PC's COM or USB "
"port (some GPS may require an FTDI adapter) or by using an app like `GPS to "
"Bluetooth "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cajax.gps2bt2&hl=en_US&gl=US>`__"
" on your phone to feed GPS data via a Bluetooth serial COM port to Mission "
"Planner."
msgstr ""
"可以通过将 GPS 连接到 PC 的 COM 或 USB 端口（某些 GPS 可能需要 FTDI 适配器），或在手机上使用 `GPS to "
"Bluetooth "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cajax.gps2bt2&hl=en_US&gl=US>`__"
" 等应用，通过蓝牙串口 COM 端口向 Mission Planner 提供 GPS 数据来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:27 07cf098cf15c48c5bbf0c4d9e60dad87
msgid ""
"The COM port and baud rate (normally 9600) are entered in the ``GCS GPS`` "
"dialogs and then Connect to Base GPS pushed. If successful, location data "
"will immediately appear below those dialog boxes."
msgstr ""
"在 ``GCS GPS`` 对话框中输入 COM 端口和波特率（通常为 9600），然后点击「Connect to Base "
"GPS」。成功后，位置数据将立即显示在对话框下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:29 1c43af32da214171af18f471ec81aeb0
msgid ""
"GPS raw output can be viewed in real time by double clicking the GPS status "
"string under the COM Port dropdown."
msgstr "双击 COM 端口下拉菜单下方的 GPS 状态字符串，可实时查看 GPS 原始输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:32 288f7dd0fb774f8d85f7ae7f8d7f1c7a
msgid "Remote ID Status Box"
msgstr "Remote ID 状态框"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:34 6ee88f9d27294226b870361767add6ce
msgid ""
"GCS GPS: Red - Lost Connection to GPS, Orange - Connected, no Fix, Yellow - "
"Fix, no DGPS and Green - DGPS Fix."
msgstr "GCS GPS：红色——GPS 连接丢失；橙色——已连接但无定位；黄色——已定位但无 DGPS；绿色——DGPS 定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:35 6e0e0692291441599376470e559a71b2
msgid ""
"RID Comms: Green - Healthy Connection, Red - Timeout (Currently 5 seconds)"
msgstr "RID 通信：绿色——连接正常；红色——超时（当前为 5 秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:36 7d4396151ad3447d90cabbb745b6e26b
msgid ""
"ARM Status: Green when Armed, Otherwise Red with Reason in RID Armed Status "
"Reason in Status tab."
msgstr "解锁状态：已解锁时显示绿色，否则显示红色，并在 Status 标签页的「RID Armed Status Reason」中显示原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:37 618679d8e7b8439bafda1ab4e318f385
msgid ""
"UAS ID: Red when the UAS ID tab is not fully populated. Typically, this "
"information will be provided by the RID module when using Standard ID, and "
"may be populated by the user in future implementation of after-market or "
"add-on RemoteID Broadcast Modules."
msgstr ""
"UAS ID：当「UAS ID」标签页信息未填写完整时显示红色。通常情况下，使用 Standard ID 时该信息由 RID "
"模块提供；在未来针对售后或附加 RemoteID 广播模块的实现中，也可由用户手动填写。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:40 af65bbf1240b4ea393a9c24d8d8fed6c
msgid "String Setup Tabs"
msgstr "字符串设置标签页"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:42 b44083c4dfa84809a19aea2417aab5f2
msgid ""
"Two tabs are provided for input of UAS and Operator information in these "
"initial test and development version of the interface. Some of these may "
"become read-only and obtained from the RemoteID module in the future, "
"depending on jurisdiction and implementation. They are provided for "
"experimentation and testing initially."
msgstr ""
"在接口的初始测试与开发版本中，提供了两个标签页用于输入 UAS 和操作员信息。其中部分信息在未来可能会变为只读并从 RemoteID "
"模块中获取，具体取决于司法管辖区和实现方式。目前这些标签页仅供实验和测试使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:45 0f427a0b07244e2a92179c9228a6be53
msgid "Master Status Indicator"
msgstr "主状态指示器"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:46 ba5731863d534ae29651ee01167450d9
msgid ""
"Located in the left middle side of the panel. The master status will "
"indicate RED if any conditions for proper operation are not valid."
msgstr "位于面板左侧中部。若正常运行所需的任何条件不满足，主状态指示器将显示红色。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:48 bee2a9cb756d4214bce80bdc26649839
msgid ""
"Local regulations may require such a master indicator. In Mission Planner, "
"this will be present in this tab as well as on the map (pending)."
msgstr "当地法规可能要求设置此类主指示器。在 Mission Planner 中，该指示器将出现在本标签页以及地图上（待实现）。"
